# Git 提交信息（Source Control 自动生成）

When Cursor auto-generates a Git commit message for this repository, follow ALL rules below.

## Hard requirements

1. MUST use Conventional Commits: `<type>[!][(scope)]: <subject>`（scope optional）
2. MUST write the subject (and body if any) in Simplified Chinese (简体中文)
3. NEVER write the commit subject entirely in English
4. NEVER use vague subjects: `update`, `fix bug`, `wip`, `misc`, `临时提交`
5. Keep ONE concise subject line (≤72 characters); do NOT end with `。` or `.`
6. Subject = WHAT changed (祈使：修复/新增/调整); body = WHY (optional); blank line between subject and body; wrap body ~72 chars; no file-list dump
7. One commit = one concern; do NOT list filenames in the subject
8. Allowed types (lowercase): feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, revert
9. Preferred scopes for this repo (lowercase, optional): `<scope-1>`, `<scope-2>`, `<scope-3>`；文档用 `docs` / `docs(<模块>)`，勿用 `docs(doc)`；CI 用 type `ci`，勿用 `chore(ci)`
10. Breaking change: use `type(scope)!: …` and/or a footer `BREAKING CHANGE: …` in Chinese
11. Revert: `revert: <原提交简述>` with body `This reverts commit <hash>.`
12. Footers when useful: `Refs: #123` / `Closes: #123` / `Fixes: #123`

## Examples (copy the style, not the English)

- feat(<scope-1>): <中文功能简述>
- fix(<scope-2>): <中文缺陷简述>
- refactor(<scope-3>): <中文重构简述>
- docs(<scope-1>): <中文文档简述>
- ci: <中文 CI 简述>
- chore: <中文杂项简述>
- revert: <被回滚提交的原简述>

## Wrong vs right

- ❌ `Refactor auth module for better performance.`
- ✅ `refactor(<scope-1>): 优化认证模块以降低重复请求`
- ❌ `fix: update login bug`
- ✅ `fix(<scope-2>): 修复登录态过期未刷新的问题`
- ❌ `chore(ci): update workflow`
- ✅ `ci: 调整同步工作流触发策略`
- ❌ `docs(doc): update readme`
- ✅ `docs: 补充本地开发环境说明`
